DESCRIPTION:45-minute very easy spin at 100–130W (pure aerobic flush\, no
  targets) — skip the 100 km distance entirely.\n\nReason: The athlete ha
 s had near-zero training for 4 weeks post-illness and body battery is chro
 nically depleted\; attempting a 100 km effort on the first day back risks 
 setback rather than adaptation.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-29
END:VEVENT
