SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] swimming — 30-minute easy open-water swim (~1\,000
 –1\,200m)\, purely to re
DESCRIPTION:30-minute easy open-water swim (~1\,000–1\,200m)\, purely to 
 re-establish feel for the water — no pace target\, no distance pressure.
 \n\nReason: With the Half Oceanman 35 days away\, reintroducing open-water
  swimming is correct\, but the volume and pace targets are too aggressive 
 for a first session back after 4 weeks of illness-related inactivity.\n\nA
 I coaching 2026-08-29
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai-coaching-20260830-2@jean-tri
