SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] running — Easy aerobic run of 10–12 km at 6:45–
 7:15/km\, stopping immed
DESCRIPTION:Easy aerobic run of 10–12 km at 6:45–7:15/km\, stopping imm
 ediately if fatigue or discomfort arises.\n\nReason: Jumping to 19 km afte
 r 4 weeks of essentially zero running following illness is a significant i
 njury and relapse risk\; a half-distance effort rebuilds continuity safely
 .\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-29
END:VEVENT
