SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] cycling — 75–90 km at 128–155W (lower end of Z2
  only)\, capping ride ti
DESCRIPTION:75–90 km at 128–155W (lower end of Z2 only)\, capping ride 
 time at 180 min — no Z3 blocks.\n\nReason: Given only one easy bike sess
 ion planned for Wk10 re-entry\, jumping straight to a full 105 km / 4-hour
  ride in Wk11 is too large a single-week load increase for someone returni
 ng from extended illness.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-29
END:VEVENT
