SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] running — 14–15 km at 6:30–6:50/km (approx 100 
 min) — steady aerobic\, 
DESCRIPTION:14–15 km at 6:30–6:50/km (approx 100 min) — steady aerobi
 c\, no negative-split attempt.\n\nReason: With a reduced Wk10 long run as 
 the starting point\, a moderate step up to 14–15 km is appropriate progr
 essive overload\; the full 19.5 km would exceed a safe 10% weekly volume i
 ncrease from a near-zero base.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-29
END:VEVENT
