SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] cycling — 90–100 km at 128–177W including 2×10
  min at 178–200W tempo b
DESCRIPTION:90–100 km at 128–177W including 2×10 min at 178–200W tem
 po blocks — begin adding controlled intensity ahead of the Half Oceanman
  on ~3 Oct.\n\nReason: By Wk12 the athlete should have rebuilt aerobic con
 tinuity sufficiently to tolerate some tempo stimulus\, but keeping distanc
 e at 90–100 km rather than 110 km preserves recovery capacity with the H
 alf Oceanman now only ~21 days away.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-29
